00:01:18.166 --> 00:01:21.709
and really bringing all that Broadway experience has been amazing.

00:01:21.792 --> 00:01:23.709
It was a dazzling cast

00:01:23.792 --> 00:01:27.834
on top of Cinco’s great creativity and Barry Sonnenfeld’s vision.

00:01:27.917 --> 00:01:33.041
What I liked about Cinco’s scripts were A, they were very funny

00:01:33.125 --> 00:01:36.834
